---
description: Resume AI, chat, and @portfolio/ai changes
globs: packages/ai/**,apps/admin/src/lib/resume-ai/**,apps/web/src/app/api/chat/**,apps/admin/src/app/api/resume/**
---

- Structured output via Zod `.strict()` schemas only (`packages/ai/src/schemas`).
- Untrusted JD text goes through `stripPromptInjection` then `wrapUntrusted`.
- Never skip `enforceResumeGenerationPolicy` or `validateFabrication` before returning model output to the UI.
- New model IDs need pricing in `packages/ai/src/telemetry.ts` or the daily cost cap undercounts.
- Prompt or policy changes update `specs/resume-ai.md` and add a fixture case in `packages/ai/src/evals/cases/`.
- Do not call live LLM APIs from unit tests. Mock `generateObject` / `streamText`.
